	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE:\nJ6 shares SPI1 (SCK/MISO/MOSI) with the on-board AS5047P (U1).\nIsolation is by chip select only: U1 on PA4, remote on PC4.\nAS5047P tri-states MISO when CSn is high (datasheet t_OZ), so two\nslaves on one bus is valid - but firmware MUST NOT assert both\nchip selects."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 306.07 160.7462 0)
		(size 46.99 22.35)
